#EXTM3U
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ADRIAN TV bundled DEMO playlist.
# These are publicly published, licence-friendly test streams (Blender
# Foundation open movies, Mux/Unified Streaming test HLS, MDN sample clips)
# used only to exercise the player during development. They are not real TV
# channels and are clearly separated from user-configured production sources.
# Note: Chrome cannot play the .m3u8 entries (no native HLS); they work on
# Android/Windows via media_kit's libmpv. The .mp4 entries play everywhere.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
